#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-peripherals.rst:7
#: 55c991a5cffc487cb1d6626c5e29d1e4
msgid ""
"DroneCAN was created to continue the development of the widely used UAVCAN "
"v0 protocol. This protocol has proven itself as robust and feature rich and "
"has been widely deployed in the commercial drone industry and enjoys broad "
"support among industry partners. The proposed introduction of the UAVCAN v1 "
"protocol involved changes to UAVCAN that increased complexity and did not "
"offer a smooth migration path for existing deployments. After extended "
"discussions within the UAVCAN consortium it was decided that the best "
"solution was to continue development of UAVCAN v0 under the name DroneCAN."
msgstr ""
"DroneCAN 的诞生是为了继续广泛使用的 UAVCAN v0 "
"协议的开发。该协议已被证明稳健且功能丰富，在商业无人机行业得到广泛部署，并获得业界合作伙伴的广泛支持。UAVCAN v1 协议的引入涉及对 UAVCAN"
" 的变更，增加了复杂性，且未为现有部署提供顺畅的迁移路径。经过 UAVCAN 联盟内部长期讨论，决定以 DroneCAN 为名继续开发 UAVCAN "
"v0。"

